## Iridium 1.0.22 - Complete CLI Redesign

### CLI UX Improvements
- **Instant menu selection** - no more pressing Enter after each choice
- **Single-key navigation** - press 1-9 or a-z to navigate instantly
- **Confirmation dialogs** for dangerous actions (delete, restart, uninstall)
- **All submenus redesigned** with consistent styling

### IP/ISP Display Fix
- Fixed IP and ISP not displaying in main menu
- Added caching (5 min) to speed up menu loading
- Multiple fallback services for IP detection (ip.sb, ifconfig.me, ipinfo.io)

### Menu Navigation
- Use letters (a, b, c...) for options beyond 9 in Advanced Settings
- Press 'q' to go back from any menu
- Press '0' to go back (same as before)

### Visual Updates
- Cleaner status display in all submenus
- Colored indicators for service status
- Modern section headers
